      "rationale": "Recent organization-level activity supports ongoing development [c7], but sustained shipping on the agent-payment product is unproven [c8]. Creation and last-push dates do not establish that pushes occurred only on those dates; repository age and count [c9] also do not establish multiple active contributors."
